grader-v1: frozen copy of the GDPevo rule graders (evaluator code, per-task eval configuration, and released reference answers) for task groups 008-011, 013-016, 017-020, taken from https://github.com/Prism-Shadow/GDPevo (Apache License 2.0, Copyright the GDPevo authors) on 2026-09-10, with two documented patches (TG015 contact-field containment check; TG018 fee-row deduplication and total consistency). See docs/gdpevo_adapter.md for the tree hash and control results. Reference answers here are the same public artifacts released upstream; they live on the oracle side only and are never mounted into solver, evolver, or judge containers.
